Subject: Select camera data lifetime independently of unfinished playback

Upstream-base: 9f985f9aca654d7ec13ff894830f19aeb3f7aefd

Extract original cCameraData initialization and pair owned arrays with nlFree
on native hosts. Initialize the ownership flag for partial allocation rollback.
Camera playback and the original registry remain unselected.

